{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13103080","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13103080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1310307001:":{"text":"훠이!","source_cn":"嘿！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC521FEDD06E6A836","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1310307002:":{"text":"으악!! 귀신이다!!!","source_cn":"啊、有鬼啊——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2290C2EACDB89DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310308001:0":{"text":"하하, 내가 이겼어요! 역시 제 죽은 연기가 제일 무섭죠!","source_cn":"哈哈，我赢了！我扮演的“死者”是最恐怖的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73614122852F2BA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310308002:0":{"text":"윽, 치피가... 기절한 건가요? 괜찮아요?","source_cn":"呃，满满他……晕了？他还好吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EAFD574073564E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1310308002":{"text":"윽, 치피가... 기절한 건가요? 괜찮아요?","source_cn":"呃，满满他……晕了？他还好吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EAFD574073564E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310308004:0":{"text":"아... 그렇다면 다행이네요. 치피도 나름 경험이 풍부한 기사인데 이렇게 쉽게 놀랄 리가 없죠!","source_cn":"啊……没事就好。我就说嘛，满满也是个经历丰富的小骑士，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6132DE5497098FA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310308005:0":{"text":"하하, 저도 여러분처럼 “고스트 하우스”에 참가하러 온 거예요. 다만 저는 이곳의 스태프일 뿐이구요!","source_cn":"哈哈，和你们一样，我也是来参加“鬼影密室”的。只不过我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ABA43A139A605F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310308006:0":{"text":"스태프요? 여기서 시체로 분장하는 게 일인가요?","source_cn":"工作人员？你的工作就是在这里扮尸体？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AB4EF97BFE4AA5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310308007:0":{"text":"크흠, 당연하죠! 이건 “고스트 하우스”의 아슬아슬하고 심장이 쫄깃해지는 분위기를 연출하기 위해서예요! 그렇죠, 게르다? 그러니 상품은 저에게 주셔야 해요!","source_cn":"咳，当然！这是为了衬托“鬼影密室”那种惊险刺激、让人心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76D51E902512C4D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1310308008:0":{"text":"우리 토끼씨가 이렇게 잘할 줄은 몰랐네요. 이렇게 하죠, 여관의 모든 비용은 무료로 처리해 드릴게요. 어떠세요?","source_cn":"没想到我们的兔先生还真有一套。这样吧，你在旅店的所有花...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AD3FF0D1EBB7A74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1310308009:0":{"text":"와우, 너무 좋아요! 역시 제가 본 여사장님 중에 가장 호쾌하신 분이군요!","source_cn":"哇哦，太棒了！你真是我见过的最慷慨、最大方、最豪爽的老板娘！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62CA7BC686A30DBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1310308010:0":{"text":"어라? 호쾌하기만 한가요? 아름답지는 않고요?","source_cn":"咦？只是最大方最豪爽，不是最美丽的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DB69C78AE43CC49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1310308011:0":{"text":"아뇨, 아뇨, 물론 매우 아름다우시기도 하죠!","source_cn":"不不不，当然也是最美丽的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x030816704BC8F62D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1310308012:0":{"text":"...잠깐만, 잠깐만요! 이게 대체 어떻게 된 일이죠?!","source_cn":"——等等，等等！这到底是怎么回事？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6D501A59F9049E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1310308013:0":{"text":"로잔, 어쩌다가 시더 마을로 오게 된 거예요?!","source_cn":"洛桑，你怎么会到雪松镇来？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22D6EBAEA4757E21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"로잔, 어떻게 네가?!","source_cn":"洛桑，怎么是你？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6A7C3E9B93B6CC08","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"로잔, 어떻게 네가?!","female":"로잔, 어떻게 네가?!","variant_male_record_index":"68554","variant_female_record_index":"68555","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"조금 있으면 깨어날 거야","source_cn":"应该过一会就醒了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x696D301995EE4C9A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"조금 있으면 깨어날 거야","female":"조금 있으면 깨어날 거야","variant_male_record_index":"68556","variant_female_record_index":"68557","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1310308003:0":{"text":"아, 저도 이곳에서 여러분을 만나게 될 줄은 몰랐어요! 게다가 치피를 놀라게 하기까지...","source_cn":"哎呀，我也没想到会在这里碰到你们！而且，还吓到了满满……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BBC5C991DE6B8FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:2:3":{"text":"어떻게 “부활” 하게 된 거야?","source_cn":"你怎么“死而复生”了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF79A145A0D47481E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"어떻게 “부활” 하게 된 거야?","female":"어떻게 “부활” 하게 된 거야?","variant_male_record_index":"68558","variant_female_record_index":"68559","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:24:13010322:0":{"text":"깜짝 놀란 치피가 로잔의 “시체”를 살펴보았다. 그러자 갑자기 “죽은 척”하던 로잔이 벌떡 일어났다.","source_cn":"满满惊慌地上前查看洛桑的“尸体”，没想到洛桑却突然“诈...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE8BCB21C39819C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","documen